                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 3010/4.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Fox</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-01-04"><hi rendition="#italic">January 4,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Root instructs Mr. Fox to convey the President’s congratulations and good
                    wishes to General Alfaro.)</p>
            </div>
